{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"fontaine_geography","name_zh":"枫丹大区与大枫丹湖","name_en":"Regions of Fontaine","aliases":["枫丹大区与大枫丹湖","Regions of Fontaine","万水之源·大枫丹湖","Great Terrestrial Lake"],"category":"geography","scope":"regional","regions":["Fontaine"],"summary":"枫丹位于提瓦特中部，主体坐落于显著抬升的大陆板块上，边缘形成巨型瀑布，中央地上水域为大枫丹湖。现有资料列出白露区、苍晶区、枫丹廷区、伊黎耶林区、枫丹动能工程科学研究院区、黎翡区、莫尔泰区、诺思托伊区和旧日之海九个主要区域；其中诺思托伊区位于主体高原之外，旧日之海则保存着与大枫丹湖及古代高海相连的沉没水域与遗迹。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"fontaine_geography_fact_01","text":"枫丹位于提瓦特中部，被描述为地上之海与大陆诸水的源流之地；其主体大陆板块显著高于其他国家，边缘形成绵延数千米的巨大瀑布。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今总体地貌","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_02","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_11"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_geography_fact_02","text":"现有资料列出的枫丹主要区域为白露区、苍晶区、枫丹廷区、伊黎耶林区、枫丹动能工程科学研究院区、黎翡区、莫尔泰区、诺思托伊区和旧日之海。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现行地理划分","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_02","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_04","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_05","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_06","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_07","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_08","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_09","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_10","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_11","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_12","bwiki_fontaine_geography"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_geography_fact_03","text":"大枫丹湖是枫丹的中央地上水域；中文核验材料给出的全名为“万水之源·大枫丹湖”，英文材料称其为“Great Terrestrial Lake”。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今及历史地理称谓","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_02","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_12","local_sup_fontaine_geography_02","bwiki_fontaine_geography"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_geography_fact_04","text":"旧日之海位于大枫丹湖以南的深水区域，包含沉入海中的古代遗迹；其广阔水域过去曾是同一片高海不可分割的一部分。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"古代至现今","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_12","local_sup_fontaine_geography_02"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_geography_fact_05","text":"呜斯先生称，在旧日之海所在水域坠落以前，那里曾属于大枫丹湖，雷穆利亚王城亦曾坐落于此。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"雷穆利亚时期及水域坠落以前","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["local_sup_fontaine_geography_02"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_geography_fact_06","text":"诺思托伊区位于枫丹南方，以佩特莉可镇和褪色古堡为主要子区域；它不在枫丹主体所处的抬升大陆板块上，褪色古堡内有通往更深处旧日之海的入口。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今地貌","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_11","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_12","bwiki_fontaine_geography"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_geography_fact_07","text":"枫丹各区同时包含山原、森林、岛屿、港口以及水下设施和遗迹：苍晶区的山地与枫丹廷隔水相望，白露区包含沿瀑布建立的海露港一带，伊黎耶林区分布有湖泊、林道与重要港口，黎翡区则包含位于水下的梅洛彼得堡。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今地貌","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_05","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_06","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_07","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_09","bwiki_fontaine_geography"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_geography_fact_08","text":"枫丹动能工程科学研究院区因昔年的爆炸发生显著地貌变化：研究院大部分设施被毁，并留下悬浮于空中的异重力凝水体；研究院此后以新枫丹科学院为现驻地。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"研究院爆炸后至现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_08","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_01","bwiki_fontaine_geography"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"雷穆利亚时期及水域坠落以前","order_hint":10,"events":["呜斯先生称，今日旧日之海所在水域当时属于大枫丹湖，雷穆利亚王城坐落于此；英文地理描述亦称大枫丹湖以南的水域过去是同一片高海的一部分。"],"current_status":"该水域如今位于深海，保存着沉没的古代遗迹，并作为旧日之海归入枫丹区域。","source_ids":["local_sup_fontaine_geography_02","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_12"]},{"period":"枫丹科学院中央实验室爆炸之后","order_hint":20,"events":["研究院大部分设施在爆炸中被毁，中央实验室成为遗址，并留下悬浮的异重力凝水体。"],"current_status":"新枫丹科学院现为研究院驻地，中央实验室遗址及爆炸遗留地貌仍然存在。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_08","fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_01","bwiki_fontaine_geography"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"枫丹居民及常来往当地的人通常可以知道枫丹位于高原地上水域、以大枫丹湖为中央水域，并划分为多个地表与水下区域；旧日之海与大枫丹湖的古代联系属于更专门的历史地理知识。","likely_known_by":["枫丹本地居民","枫丹行政、港务及交通从业者","往来枫丹各港口的水手与商人","潜水员、测绘者及地理研究者","枫丹科学院研究人员","研究雷穆利亚与旧日之海的学者或亲历相关事件者"],"unlikely_known_by":["很少接触枫丹的普通外国居民","不了解水下区域的短期访客","未接触雷穆利亚资料者对旧日之海古代地理的具体认识"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["枫丹通常被称作大陆水系的源流之地。","大枫丹湖被视为枫丹中央的地上湖泊或地上之海。","旧日之海与大枫丹湖的历史关系并非仅凭现今地貌便能直接判断。"]},"activation_keys":["枫丹大区与大枫丹湖","Regions of Fontaine"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["传送锚点、地图页签、区域解锁条件与任务开放条件","观景点收集、图鉴隐藏条件及探索进度","玩家潜水能力、体力、战斗操作和水下能力获取方式","宝箱、成就、秘境、首领、敌人、地方特产及探索解谜机制","版本开放记录、游戏原声播放区域及活动玩法"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["芒索斯山主峰高于龙脊雪山的比较性说法未获 Fandom 或本地游戏文本支持。","“Great Fontaine Lake”只出现在检索元数据与缺页报错中，不能据此认定为已经正文核验的正式英文名。","证据未给出大枫丹湖湖岸及各区水域边界的完整精确地图，故不补写具体边界线。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_fontaine_geography","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Viewpoint/Fontaine","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Viewpoint/Fontaine","language":"en","revision_id":"1859913","source_text_sha256":"d5a735fdd25a26c873f3810214708fa7d9b34a0813697a3d0c63817df8e60796"},{"source_id":"bwiki_fontaine_geography","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"枫丹·地理","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E6%9E%AB%E4%B8%B9%C2%B7%E5%9C%B0%E7%90%86","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"627293","source_text_sha256":"cca5d884b1956b588dfb1b1dbb86e437f2f6863c5fa1cab750c3fac48160ff13"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Viewpoint/Fontaine","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Viewpoint/Fontaine","language":"en","revision_id":"1859913","source_text_sha256":"10733292d4980e07b8af8fe5c1a039d4eff74aec2c88248eab91faa76c674978"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Fontaine","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Fontaine","language":"en","revision_id":"2134720","source_text_sha256":"a8680376fe6585475a3125369274344a7338c3d2dff92ebc6ff58e8185cf36f4"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Court of Fontaine Region","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Court_of_Fontaine_Region","language":"en","revision_id":"1735640","source_text_sha256":"5c1fff13dae051e307a8f7b4621c301c39a182199ff58ad28a4cfa7a728ecf81"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_05","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Beryl Region","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Beryl_Region","language":"en","revision_id":"2105776","source_text_sha256":"bc59bf05e388e53fe71844723d608a36ed48482bc0fbe88c1160c05be2f42bfc"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_06","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Belleau Region","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Belleau_Region","language":"en","revision_id":"2105775","source_text_sha256":"5ab704169c85907741b57aad750a4799bfacf8a6664627319c9fc404b0c83579"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_07","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Liffey Region","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Liffey_Region","language":"en","revision_id":"2105779","source_text_sha256":"9b3488da2e97370e4c07458409e4878573df308346554d29b6aa28f1623c250b"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_08","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Fontaine Research Institute of Kinetic Energy Engineering Region","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Fontaine_Research_Institute_of_Kinetic_Energy_Engineering_Region","language":"en","revision_id":"2105778","source_text_sha256":"7908166c8acbb1930607c997ad5a166c6d361fb251a3ff61a663f6074215b8aa"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_09","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Erinnyes Forest","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Erinnyes_Forest","language":"en","revision_id":"2105777","source_text_sha256":"7b9e4d6a8078e97152f535bd0fbbb79d035cec9ce2a778f1b58fbb7c2d183ebc"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_geography_10","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Morte Region","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Morte_Region","language":"en","revision_id":"2105780","source_text_sha256":"f89d4749b0b4